  id: explosive
  displayName: Explosive
  description: Whatever the wearer finishes off does not go quietly -- the kill splashes
    onto whoever was standing next to it. The exact mechanism Trample already uses,
    so a Black Ram wearing this alongside his own talent gets two independent splashes
    off one kill rather than one doubled splash -- see OnKillSplashPercent's own
    comment on why that is deliberate, not a bug to fix later. Already single-effect
    since Phase C; untouched by the affix split.
